WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.267
Coding Exercise 5 keeps every employee row and adds
a salary rank within each department Because

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.833
the detail rows must remain do not collapse the
table with GROUP

00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:16.504
BY Use a ranking window function The partition

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.819
should separate departments and the ordering should
place the highest salary first

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:27.676
Run and Check then scan each department The
highest-paid employee in each

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:33.243
department should have rank one If several
departments all have a rank-one

00:00:33.256 --> 00:00:40.120
employee that is correct The ranking restarts
because of the partition This

00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:44.567
exercise is testing whether you can recognize when
analytical context belongs in

00:00:44.593 --> 00:00:47.028
a window function rather than in a grouped summary
